OL,3,GNEWSAPost office closure's
OL,4,A'significant' local impact
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe closure of a city post office will
OL,7,Fhave a "significant impact" on the
OL,8,Farea's future, local people fear.
OL,10,FTruro post office, which was within a
OL,11,Fbranch of TG Jones, officially closed
OL,12,Fon Tuesday after the high street
OL,13,Fretailer announced in May up to 150 of
OL,14,Fits 480 stores would close as part of a
OL,15,Frestructuring plan.
OL,17,FJayne Kirkham, Labour MP for Truro and
OL,18,FFalmouth, who has been campaigning to
OL,19,Fkeep the branch, said the post office
OL,20,Fprovided "invaluable" face-to-face
OL,21,Fservices and helped keep the high
OL,22,Fstreet "alive".
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
