OL,3,GNEWSAPost office closure's
OL,4,A'significant' local impact
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the Post Office said
OL,7,Fthe vacancy for a Truro branch had
OL,8,Falready been advertised and it was in
OL,9,Fthe "early stages" of reviewing
OL,10,Fapplications.
